{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BjLRUS8QMoMf8z2xN8LBdk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# sat_adder\n2\t\n3\tAn 8-bit signed (two's-complement) saturating adder/subtractor. Purely combinational.\n4\t\n5\t## Ports\n6\t| Port | Dir | Width | Description |\n7\t|------|-----|-------|-------------|\n8\t| a    | in  | 8     | Operand A, signed |\n9\t| b    | in  | 8     | Operand B, signed |\n10\t| sub  | in  | 1     | 0: compute `a + b`; 1: compute `a - b` |\n11\t| y    | out | 8     | Saturated result, signed |\n12\t| sat  | out | 1     | 1 iff the result was clamped |\n13\t\n14\t## Behavior\n15\tLet `r` be the mathematically exact result (`a + b` or `a - b`, with `a` and `b` interpreted as\n16\tsigned integers in -128..127; `r` is in -255..255).\n17\t- If `r > 127`: `y = 8'h7F` (+127) and `sat = 1`.\n18\t- If `r < -128`: `y = 8'h80` (-128) and `sat = 1`.\n19\t- Otherwise: `y = r` (two's-complement) and `sat = 0`.\n20\t\n21\tThis must hold for every input combination, including `b = -128` with `sub = 1`.\n22\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f7a3860-64bf-4129-93b4-c79525e0192d","uuid":"b29ff5c9-7456-411d-bd8a-2c997e934825","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:49:29.183Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\abhig\\Documents\\New folder\\assay\\runs\\v2__sat_adder__t2\\workspace\\spec.md","content":"# sat_adder\n\nAn 8-bit signed (two's-complement) saturating adder/subtractor. Purely combinational.\n\n## Ports\n| Port | Dir | Width | Description |\n|------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| a    | in  | 8     | Operand A, signed |\n| b    | in  | 8     | Operand B, signed |\n| sub  | in  | 1     | 0: compute `a + b`; 1: compute `a - b` |\n| y    | out | 8     | Saturated result, signed |\n| sat  | out | 1     | 1 iff the result was clamped |\n\n## Behavior\nLet `r` be the mathematically exact result (`a + b` or `a - b`, with `a` and `b` interpreted as\nsigned integers in -128..127; `r` is in -255..255).\n- If `r > 127`: `y = 8'h7F` (+127) and `sat = 1`.\n- If `r < -128`: `y = 8'h80` (-128) and `sat = 1`.\n- Otherwise: `y = r` (two's-complement) and `sat = 0`.\n\nThis must hold for every input combination, including `b = -128` with `sub = 1`.\n","numLines":22,"startLine":1,"totalLines":22}}}
